{"id":"strafzettel","lemma":"Strafzettel","pos":"noun","rank":4748,"glosses":["traffic ticket","parking ticket"],"ipa":"/ˈʃtʁaːfˌt͡sɛtl̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bd/De-Strafzettel.ogg/De-Strafzettel.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Strafzettels","plural":"Strafzettel"},"examples":[{"text":"Tom hat einen Strafzettel bekommen.","en":"Tom got a ticket.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to receive"}]},{"text":"Ich habe einen Strafzettel bekommen, weil ich nicht angeschnallt war.","en":"I was fined for not wearing a seatbelt.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to receive"},{"g":"because, given that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"strapped"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Wenn du hier geparkt hättest, dann hättest du einen Strafzettel bekommen.","en":"If you'd parked your car here, you'd have been fined.","words":[{"g":"if / when"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"to park","l":"parken"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"then, after that"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to receive"}]},{"text":"Hast du schon einmal einen Strafzettel für Schnellfahren bekommen?","en":"Have you ever gotten a speeding ticket?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"already"},{"g":"once, one time"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"for"},null,{"g":"to receive"}]},{"text":"Tom bekam einen Strafzettel für zu schnelles Fahren.","en":"Tom was fined for speeding.","words":[null,{"g":"to receive","l":"bekommen"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"quickly","l":"schnell"},{"g":"to go at speed"}]}]}